    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d6">

                <pb facs="0016" n="4" xml:id="pg4"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">033.4111 Eden, Anthony/1<hi
                        rendition="#superscript">2/5</hi>
                </note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum of Conversation, by the Secretary of
                        State</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1943-02-16">February 16, 1943</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The British Ambassador called at his request and said that Eden expected to leave
                    London for this country about the middle of next week. I expressed special
                    gratification at his coming and assured him of the warmest greeting and welcome.
                    I said we had no agenda or program thus far but that we were now working on
                    various phases of such an arrangement. I stated that whatever we may develop I
                    shall be glad to acquaint him accordingly and that I hoped the Ambassador in
                    turn would do likewise with me.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>C[<hi rendition="#small-caps">ordell</hi>] H[<hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >ull</hi>]</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
